Your blood turns into an acidic mixture. When you get hit, the attacker is splashed with acid.

This deals [17, 23, 27, 31, 34 (TL1-5; SP 100)] acid damage each turn for 5 turns, and reduces the attacker's Accuracy by [19, 26, 31, 36, 40 (TL1-5; SP 100)].

At level 3, it will also reduce Armour by [22, 30, 36, 41, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100)] for 5 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
